          "textSha256": "5e6a7602f80c3856875e5461aab1b1d20404dcf8dd761d34b9cd8698b9196154"
        }
      ],
      "recommendation": "Keep the frozen syllabus and the same three outcomes, but collect the shell, Git, and AI responses before displaying the corresponding answer-bearing refreshers; use feedback after each response for remediation. Align the HTML title, h1, and opening copy with the manifest title or explicitly label the page low-stakes formative practice and distinguish it from the separate Tooling module check assessment.",
